\kappa)\\land\\lambda&lt;j(\\kappa)\\land\\forall f\\in V\\;((\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\lambda\\land\\operatorname{ran}(f)\\subseteq M)\\to f\\in M)\\land j(\\ell)(\\kappa)=x\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the supercompact-style anticipation property.  Class elementarity is stated in the two-sorted metatheory instead of applying the set-coded elementary-embedding predicate to the proper class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>; critical point and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>-sequence closure are expanded explicitly.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,\\ell,x,\\lambda\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"j,M","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists_{\\mathsf{Class}}","display":false},{"tex":"j:V\\prec M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4LaverFunction}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard4\\text{-}laver\\text{-}function} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4LaverFunction}_S(\\kappa,\\ell)\\leftrigh